  "question": {
    "text": "A piece of metal floats in mercury. The coefficients of volume expansion of the metal and mercury are <math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>γ</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;and <math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>γ</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>, respectively. If the temperatures of both mercury and the metal are increased by <math> <mrow> <mo>Δ</mo> <mtext>T</mtext> </mrow> </math>, the fraction of the volume of the metal submerged in mercury changes by the factor of"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mi>&gamma;</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>&Delta;</mo> <mtext>T</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mi>&gamma;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>&Delta;</mo> <mtext>T</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mi>&gamma;</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>&Delta;</mo> <mtext>T</mtext> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mi>&gamma;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>&Delta;</mo> <mtext>T</mtext> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mi>&gamma;</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>&Delta;</mo> <mtext>T</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mi>&gamma;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>&Delta;</mo> <mtext>T</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
